{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a single player, the 1990s style RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The volume and screen size can be controlled in the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pixel art and retro BGM makes you nostalgic. The demon king is so strong that your strategy will be needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing time: 4 hours \uff5e 12 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ending: The game has 1 ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story: It's fiction about parallel universe of Japan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can get some hints to clear this game by many NPC on the way to adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally your goal is to reach a map where has the demon castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore lots of maps and progress the story, and then defeat the demon king.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533130?t=1741019782","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533130?t=1741019782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533130/8439ab8377d612dbc9f83301fed74cc47dc0da84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741019782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533130/8439ab8377d612dbc9f83301fed74cc47dc0da84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741019782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a single player, the 1990s style RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The volume and screen size can be controlled in the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pixel art and retro BGM makes you nostalgic. The demon king is so strong that your strategy will be needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class